{
    "title": "KJV Daily Bible - Verse+Audio",
    "description": "KJV Daily Bible is a Bible study tool, it allows you read daily verses, listen to daily audio, play Bible quiz games.Immerse yourself in the timeless wisdom of the King James Bible.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n1.Daily Verses:\r\nStart your day with inspiration by receiving daily Bible verses tailored to uplift and encourage you.\r\n2.Audio Playback: \r\nListen to the soothing voice of professional narrators as they bring the Bible to life through high-quality audio recordings. Perfect for moments of reflection or on-the-go listening.\r\n3.Study Tools: \r\nEnhance your understanding with helpful study tools, including cross-references, bookmarks, and keyword search, making it easy to find relevant passages.\r\n4.Personalization: \r\nCustomize your reading experience by adjusting font size, themes, and highlighting favorite verses for quick reference.\r\n5.Prayer Journal:\r\nKeep track of your prayers and experiences in a dedicated journal within the app. Reflect on your spiritual growth and journey.\r\n\r\nExperience the spirit of the Daily Bible App: King James Version and deepen your relationship with God through daily study and prayer.",
    "descriptionHTML": "KJV Daily Bible is a Bible study tool, it allows you read daily verses, listen to daily audio, play Bible quiz games.Immerse yourself in the timeless wisdom of the King James Bible.<br><br>Key Features:<br>1.Daily Verses:<br>Start your day with inspiration by receiving daily Bible verses tailored to uplift and encourage you.<br>2.Audio Playback: <br>Listen to the soothing voice of professional narrators as they bring the Bible to life through high-quality audio recordings. Perfect for moments of reflection or on-the-go listening.<br>3.Study Tools: <br>Enhance your understanding with helpful study tools, including cross-references, bookmarks, and keyword search, making it easy to find relevant passages.<br>4.Personalization: <br>Customize your reading experience by adjusting font size, themes, and highlighting favorite verses for quick reference.<br>5.Prayer Journal:<br>Keep track of your prayers and experiences in a dedicated journal within the app. Reflect on your spiritual growth and journey.<br><br>Experience the spirit of the Daily Bible App: King James Version and deepen your relationship with God through daily study and prayer.",
